WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:05.640
So, renting the Even Realities smart
glasses was probably one of the best ways

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.720
to see how well they fit
in my everyday life,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.660
uh, before making the purchase.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.530
Being able to use them at home and at
work and during my normal routine gave

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.820
me the true sense of what their
value would be in my life.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.560
They've made a noticeable difference
in helping me stay organized,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.640
allowing me to be

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.760
quick to capture notes,
uh, transcribe meetings,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.630
and keep important information at my
fingertips so I don't miss a critical

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.140
detail throughout the day.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.980
Uh, the translation feature has been
one of the especially impressive things

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.360
that I utilize pretty regularly.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.940
Uh, I interact with tourists in my job,

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:47.060
and being able to quickly understand
conversations and gather information from

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.980
people who speak a different language
has made communication much easier.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:56.710
Overall, the rental experience
offered by Whim has exceeded my

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:02.460
expectations, and having to try the
glasses in real-life situations has made

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.500
all the difference.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.650
I highly recommend the rental program
to anyone considering Even Realities

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.580
smart glasses and trying them at home.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.780
It's been a fantastic process.
